    old "It's NTW. And I already regret telling you."
    new "Es NTW. Y ya me arrepiento de haberte dicho."

    old "Wow, really? I've never heard that before. Ever."
    new "Vaya, en serio? Nunca habia escuchado eso antes. Nunca."

    old "Yeah yeah, it's long. Got it from a movie. Moving on."
    new "Si si, es largo. Lo saque de una pelicula. Sigamos."

    old "...okay? And?"
    new "...ok? Y?"

    old "...cool. We done here?"
    new "...genial. Ya terminamos aqui?"
    old "...I don't even know what to say to that."
    new "...Ni siquiera se que decir a eso."

    old "Wow. That's... a bold choice for a first impression. Read the room, dude."
    new "Vaya. Eso es... una eleccion atrevida para una primera impresion. Lee el ambiente, viejo."

    # ORPHAN REMOVED: old Gwen astronomy intro replaced by art intro (v0.12.1)

    old "Nerds are hitting the gym now too? What a time to be alive."
    new "Los nerds tambien van al gimnasio ahora? Que epoca para estar vivo."

    old "What kind of question is that?"
    new "Que clase de pregunta es esa?"

    old "I'll leave that to your imagination. Maybe one day you'll find out."
    new "Lo dejo a tu imaginacion. Tal vez un dia lo descubras."

    # ORPHAN REMOVED: old Gwen astronomy intro replaced by art intro (v0.12.1)

    old "And... you are?"
    new "Y... tu eres?"

    old "A jock who knows his way around a keyboard? That's actually kind of hot."
    new "Un deportista que sabe manejar un teclado? Eso es algo sexy la verdad."

    old "Smooth. I'll remember that one."
    new "Suave. Me voy a acordar de esa."

    old "Maybe. Stick around and you might get a private tour."
    new "Tal vez. Quedate por aqui y quizas te de un tour privado."

    old "Hey. I'm Rogue. Southern food, rock music. Not really into talking."
    new "Oye. Soy Rogue. Comida surena, rock. No me gusta mucho hablar."

    old "Yeah. Okay."
    new "Si. Ok."

    old "Old-school? What's that supposed to mean?"
    new "Vieja escuela? Que se supone que significa eso?"

    old "...I barely know you. Slow down."
    new "...Apenas te conozco. Ve mas despacio."

    old "Hey. I'm Rogue. I guess I like southern food. I'm not great with physical contact, but I'm getting used to new experiences."
    new "Oye. Soy Rogue. Supongo que me gusta la comida surena. No soy buena con el contacto fisico, pero me estoy acostumbrando a experiencias nuevas."

    old "Good to know I'm not the only one figuring things out around here."
    new "Que bueno saber que no soy el unico tratando de entender las cosas por aqui."

    old "Old-school goth? What do you mean by that?"
    new "Gotica old-school? Que quieres decir con eso?"

    old "...You're bold, I'll give you that. But keep trying."
    new "...Eres atrevido, te lo concedo. Pero sigue intentando."

    old "Hey. I'm Rogue. Southern food, quiet places... I don't usually talk this much."
    new "Oye. Soy Rogue. Comida surena, lugares tranquilos... normalmente no hablo tanto."

    old "But... I guess I can make an exception."
    new "Pero... supongo que puedo hacer una excepcion."

    old "Real? I like that. Most people here feel... fake."
    new "De verdad? Me gusta eso. La mayoria de la gente aqui se siente... falsa."

    old "...You're trouble, aren't you? I can tell."
    new "...Eres problematico, verdad? Se nota."

    old "That was... actually kind of smooth. Don't let it go to your head."
    new "Eso fue... bastante suave la verdad. No dejes que se te suba a la cabeza."

    old "Negasonic Teenage Warhead."
    new "Negasonic Teenage Warhead."

    old "Yeah, cool. See ya."
    new "Si, genial. Nos vemos."

    old "Uh? Ok..."
    new "Eh? Ok..."

    old "No. Use it full."
    new "No. Usa el nombre completo."

    old "Right. See you."
    new "Bien. Nos vemos."

    # ── Tenny intro ──

    # Tenny self-introduction
    old "Hey, I'm Gwendolyn Tennyson. Most people here know me as Tenny, since there are already other Gwens around."
    new "Hola, soy Gwendolyn Tennyson. La mayoria aqui me conoce como Tenny, ya que hay otras Gwens por aqui."

    # Option 1 — age comment
    old "That's... a weird way to start a conversation."
    new "Eso es... una forma rara de empezar una conversacion."

    old "Yes, I'm over 18, but I definitely could have started earlier if they'd let me. I'm smart enough for that."
    new "Si, tengo mas de 18, pero definitivamente podria haber entrado antes si me dejaran. Soy lo suficientemente lista para eso."

    # Option 2 — lab partners
    old "Wait, really? You actually care about the academic part?"
    new "Espera, en serio? Realmente te importa la parte academica?"

    old "Finally, someone who gets why we're here. I like you already."
    new "Por fin, alguien que entiende por que estamos aqui. Ya me caes bien."

    # Option 3 — nickname
    old "Sure, I guess. What did you have in mind?"
    new "Claro, supongo. Que tenias en mente?"

    # Nickname reactions
    old "Tenny it is. Simple, efficient."
    new "Tenny entonces. Simple, eficiente."

    old "But... there's already a Gwen here. You know that, right?"
    new "Pero... ya hay una Gwen aqui. Lo sabes, verdad?"

    old "That's my actual name, so... sure."
    new "Ese es mi nombre real, asi que... claro."

    old "Pretty formal, but okay. At least it keeps the focus on the academic side!"
    new "Bastante formal, pero esta bien. Al menos mantiene el enfoque en lo academico!"

    old "'Gwen 2'? Seriously? ...Whatever, just don't call me that in public."
    new "'Gwen 2'? En serio? ...Lo que sea, solo no me llames asi en publico."

    old "Cathy? That's... short for my middle name. How did you know that? Are you stalking me?"
    new "Cathy? Eso es... abreviacion de mi segundo nombre. Como sabias eso? Me estas acosando?"

    old "Wait... that's my middle name. How did you know that? Are you a stalker?"
    new "Espera... ese es mi segundo nombre. Como sabias eso? Eres un acosador?"

    old "Gwen T? That's actually kind of practical. I'll take it."
    new "Gwen T? Eso es bastante practico. Lo acepto."

    old "Wait... they haven't called me that in years. How did you know about that?"
    new "Espera... ya hace anos que no me llaman asi. Como sabias eso?"

    old "Gwennie? That's... actually kind of cute. I'll allow it."
    new "Gwennie? Eso es... hasta tierno. Lo permito."

    old "Red? Short and practical. I can work with that."
    new "Red? Corto y practico. Puedo trabajar con eso."

    old "... Are you an idiot?"
    new "... Eres idiota?"

    # Tenny intro menu items
    old "You look really mature. Definitely over eighteen."
    new "Te ves muy madura. Definitivamente mayor de dieciocho."

    old "I think we could be great lab partners."
    new "Creo que podriamos ser buenos companeros de laboratorio."

    old "Can I call you something else?"
    new "Puedo llamarte de otra forma?"

    old "Keep calling you Tenny."
    new "Seguir llamandote Tenny."

    old "Gwenatron Destroyer Of Worlds X Red."
    new "Gwenatron Destroyer Of Worlds X Red."

    # Tenny intro narration (Say_Player / Narration)
    old "(Wow, I thought I got here early, but apparently someone beat me to it.)"
    new "(Vaya, pensé que había llegado temprano, pero parece que alguien se me adelantó.)"

    old "The classroom fills up as more students arrive."
    new "El salón se va llenando mientras llegan más estudiantes."

    old "(Definitely the smartest person in this room. Possibly including the professor. And probably the most modest too.)"
    new "(Definitivamente la persona más inteligente en este salón. Posiblemente incluyendo al profesor. Y probablemente la más modesta también.)"

    old "And that [_tenny.Name] girl is sharp. Could be useful to have someone around who actually takes studying seriously."
    new "Y esa chica [_tenny.Name] es aguda. Podría ser útil tener a alguien cerca que se tome los estudios en serio."
